Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.88,0:00:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's where you were hiding, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.34,0:00:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.28,0:00:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess that's gonna be your new body.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.84,0:00:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can remember when my soul\Nslipped away before I conked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.46,0:00:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You told me that you had to go, that\Nyou would make it right, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you're in the game, that you'll\Nbring it all home for the both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.48,0:00:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, I miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It would mean the world\Nif you'd call again,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.64,0:00:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.02,0:01:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.54,0:01:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is the end of\Nthe day, or the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.78,0:01:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We claimo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.04,0:02:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Nessuno può succedere un destino scelto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.60,0:02:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Roman solo il risultato\Nche voi sarete distrutti.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.52,0:02:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,L 'eterna cima esiste solo per me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.52,0:02:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Puoi cantare canzoni di\Ntristezza nel Monday senza tempo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.52,0:02:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The fear of regretting the world,\Nthe challenge of the world, is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.54,0:02:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go to peace of mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.64,0:02:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,When it takes a nap,\Nthis feeling will PDF,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.26,0:02:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,the joy of the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.78,0:02:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.96,0:02:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Vista!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.87,0:02:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.86,0:02:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the arrow and impale your stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.22,0:03:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.13,0:03:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He did a 180!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.22,0:03:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He's coming in real hot! Bruno!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.64,0:03:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to try and stop him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.42,0:03:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.33,0:03:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.62,0:03:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gotta be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.20,0:03:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.82,0:03:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cause you've got the arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.32,0:03:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Just my luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.38,0:03:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It had to crap out now!\NThe arrow! Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.48,0:03:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.52,0:03:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing I thought to swipe\Nthat stupid Kotz Beretta just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.20,0:03:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But what the hell, bullets?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.92,0:03:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,None of you told me my\Nrevolver was in such bad shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.44,0:03:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What if it was the boss who broke it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.28,0:03:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.48,0:03:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Feet before opening that\Nbig mouth, number five.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.94,0:03:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Look around, moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.98,0:03:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There ain't nothing here but air.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.32,0:03:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So how could the boss even touch us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.20,0:03:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.11,0:03:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't see anyone near us\Nwhen the darn thing broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.22,0:03:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's metal fatigue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.74,0:03:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been using it too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.08,0:03:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's totally normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.48,0:03:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, the damn crane's giving out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.74,0:04:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,All this fighting with no\Nmaintenance can't be good for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.54,0:04:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.66,0:04:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.50,0:04:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How many more times am I\Ngonna have to shoot your ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.26,0:04:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, it's my life he's after now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.48,0:04:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Simply having the arrow\Nback is no longer enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.22,0:04:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.86,0:04:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.22,0:04:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Requiem now seeks to punish me\Nbecause I dared to touch the arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.10,0:04:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.10,0:04:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A little help, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.78,0:04:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my reload?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.12,0:04:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That isn't a revolver!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.82,0:04:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna need a new magazine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.60,0:04:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It might take us longer than usual!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.84,0:04:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.50,0:04:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.42,0:04:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Joino!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.42,0:04:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Got something for ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.22,0:05:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna throw it! Go wide!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.44,0:05:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Goddammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.54,0:05:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mr. Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.30,0:05:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks fine, but still, how did...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.98,0:05:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, take a moment to think back on\Nwhat I said to you at the Colosseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.76,0:05:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I confess to not fully grasping\Nthe extent of Requiem's powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.62,0:05:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That has now changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.50,0:05:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,With his true plans in motion,\Nhe's lost interest in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.22,0:05:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, his true plans?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.98,0:05:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They're unfurling before your very eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.74,0:05:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm beginning to mutate!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.58,0:05:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why Requiem gave up on chasing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.72,0:05:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is but the first\Nstage in his grand plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.10,0:06:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,His intentions weren't\Nmerely to swap our souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.32,0:06:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He seeded our transformation\Ninto completely new beings!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.04,0:06:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The prelude is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.90,0:06:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now comes the crescendo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.86,0:06:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether or not I live is irrelevant!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.78,0:06:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The history of the world\Nhas unfolded on its
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.76,0:06:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,own path for four and\Na half billion years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.78,0:06:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Requiem will thrust it on a\Nnew one in a matter of hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.92,0:06:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.84,0:06:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The true nature of his\Npowers has been laid bare.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.02,0:06:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy, children.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.66,0:06:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Your help has been most invaluable to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.60,0:06:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The path forward is finally clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.80,0:06:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,With nothing left in my way,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.96,0:06:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,the arrow will soon be mine,\Nand it's all thanks to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.56,0:06:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is\Nhappening to these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.28,0:06:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,His power's insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.38,0:06:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You said this is happening everywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.08,0:06:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look like it's causing\Nthem any sort of pain, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.58,0:06:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,They've all got blank\Nstares on their faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.28,0:07:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But even so, I can't shake the horrible\Nthought that my body's gonna mutate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.46,0:07:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be real, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.28,0:07:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I seriously gonna mold piece by\Npiece until there's nothing left of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.30,0:07:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.32,0:07:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.04,0:07:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no stopping the process now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.50,0:07:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,In a few short hours, we will all\Nhave finished our damnable mutations.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.12,0:07:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we better not waste even a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.32,0:07:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get a move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.84,0:07:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You did this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.88,0:07:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You just had to touch\Nthe arrow, didn't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.06,0:07:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Defeat Diavolo, my big\Nfat hairy stinking ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.74,0:07:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All the arrow has done\Nis end our life sooner!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.90,0:07:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.81,0:07:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way in hell he\Ncould have foreseen this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.82,0:07:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We must refocus and figure\Nout how to take down Requiem!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.34,0:07:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.32,0:07:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Run to him, you fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.90,0:07:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Move in nice and close.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.90,0:07:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel the remainder\Nof his secrets unraveling
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.06,0:07:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,faster and faster with each step you take.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.00,0:07:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me seize the power of the arrow\Nso the world may grovel at my feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.50,0:08:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We've almost got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.84,0:08:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.75,0:08:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody stand still, right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.88,0:08:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.79,0:08:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay far apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.71,0:08:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't move a muscle! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.00,0:08:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to freeze, Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.92,0:08:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to catch up with Requiem later!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.52,0:08:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell, Giorno?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.90,0:08:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You trying to get us killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.18,0:08:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,In case you haven't\Nnoticed, my body's melting!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.76,0:08:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I took a closer look at your revolver.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.02,0:08:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The one you said just broke?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.84,0:08:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's off about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.34,0:08:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The broken piece doesn't fit quite right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.82,0:08:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That shouldn't be the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.44,0:08:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If it really were Metal Fatigue,\Nthe pieces would fit perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.70,0:08:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, what exactly are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.54,0:08:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to stay in place, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.74,0:08:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, I know what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.84,0:08:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.00,0:08:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Requiem's getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If the bullets say it's because the stupid\Ngun gave out, then that's what freakin'
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.98,0:08:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.89,0:08:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,End of story!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.81,0:08:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, it got me the sweeperetta now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.50,0:08:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The two pieces don't fit right,\Ncause a chunk probably fell off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.64,0:08:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.44,0:08:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's far more likely\Nto be something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.14,0:09:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll know for sure as soon\Nas we get that lost piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.06,0:09:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look, Golden Wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.70,0:09:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave part of the gun\Nlife and let it run loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.52,0:09:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's blind, but its\Nnose makes up for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.22,0:09:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It can pick up things our eyes might miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.18,0:09:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Little guy just proved it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.96,0:09:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He's found a critical\Npiece of this puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.70,0:09:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, come on. Forget them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.14,0:09:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I already told you it's impossible\Nfor another person to have done this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.04,0:09:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.14,0:09:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Bullets and I aren't stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.38,0:09:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We know what we're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.16,0:09:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody got anywhere close to me\Nwhen the damn revolver broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.24,0:09:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.15,0:09:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.28,0:09:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we're standing apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.76,0:09:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, his range is just a few meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.80,0:09:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.70,0:09:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No one got anywhere close to\NNarancia when he was killed either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.08,0:09:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No one besides any of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.78,0:09:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.69,0:09:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, if it really is as you say,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.90,0:09:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,and the boss does turn out\Nto possess two personas,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.96,0:10:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,that means his soul could\Nreside in anybody he chooses.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.02,0:10:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My guess, Diavolo is hiding\Nout inside one of us. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.30,0:10:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Just think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.68,0:10:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why hasn't Trish been able\Nto sense him this whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.44,0:10:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's not the only thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.04,0:10:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's also waiting for us to\Ndie doing his dirty work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.12,0:10:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you get it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.62,0:10:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the reason why your gun broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.92,0:10:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.83,0:10:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay right where you are, Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.88,0:10:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.24,0:10:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to remain out of his range!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.30,0:10:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one whose gun\Nwas destroyed, moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.48,0:10:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And the person closest to it was you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.88,0:10:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.94,0:10:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.34,0:10:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Right before Narancia\Ngot killed, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.26,0:10:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The closest one was...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.48,0:10:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Merda, I have to act quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.62,0:10:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Requiem is about to slip from my grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.80,0:11:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Churno Chuvana, you pestilent brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.80,0:11:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He's inside one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.78,0:11:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all I know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.78,0:11:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What might not be obvious is we've\Ngot him backed into a corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.46,0:11:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Diavolo might be able to\Nsic Emperor Crimson on us,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.32,0:11:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,but he still can't completely\Ncontrol his physical host.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.74,0:11:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If he did have that kind of freedom, there'd\Nbe no need for him to use subterfuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.20,0:11:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He'd just finish us all off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.74,0:11:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's exactly because he's so constrained\Nthat we're all still standing here alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.12,0:11:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We have the upper hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.84,0:11:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not waste this chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.54,0:11:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What if it's the turtle?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.28,0:11:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He was the only one around\Nme when my revolver broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.04,0:11:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's got to be Polnareff\Nwho got possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.56,0:11:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.66,0:11:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,In case you've forgotten, Requiem\Nalmost killed him just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.10,0:11:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And only because the\Nboss broke your weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.12,0:11:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss wouldn't risk letting\Ninjury befall his physical host.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.10,0:11:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, I can only\Nsense one soul in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.70,0:12:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a singular turtle\Nwith only one spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.28,0:12:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You can discern souls? That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.08,0:12:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.44,0:12:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't make direct\Nphysical contact, then no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.30,0:12:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How does that even work?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.06,0:12:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Life energy comes in clusters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.62,0:12:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Direct touch tells me how\Nmany souls in a clump.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.92,0:12:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.56,0:12:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to touch each\Nof you briefly to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.60,0:12:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There still remains one problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.68,0:12:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What if you fall within the boss's range?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.50,0:12:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a trick for that, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.90,0:12:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Polnareff kindly taught it to me earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.06,0:12:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have to look for a\Nsudden increase in blood drops.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.28,0:12:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll tell me if time has left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.98,0:12:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That might help you detect him,\Nbut the rest will all be on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.98,0:12:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The fates be willing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.70,0:12:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You might just be able to\Nnarrowly dodge his strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.78,0:12:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's definitely not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.14,0:12:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, there's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.48,0:12:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I was the furthest person from Narancia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.28,0:13:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why don't I just examine you\Nfirst and get it over with? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.90,0:13:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You can stop right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.72,0:13:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come any closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.56,0:13:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.50,0:13:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What if Diavolo's hiding in you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.12,0:13:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.02,0:13:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,By the time Narancia died,\Nhis body was an empty shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.78,0:13:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I know because my soul could travel\Nseamlessly into it, nothing stopped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.08,0:13:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm sure it's just me in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.26,0:13:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, gee, that's a\Nsuper reassuring story,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.12,0:13:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,is what I'd say if I had any\Nway of confirming it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.84,0:13:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.22,0:13:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you know for sure the boss\Nisn't actually hiding somewhere in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.28,0:13:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look like you can check\Nyourself with that ability, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.00,0:13:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, if you keep this up,\Nwe can kiss the arrow goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.54,0:13:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop or you'll kiss your kneecaps goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.94,0:14:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.86,0:14:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You can check me first, Giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.26,0:14:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.00,0:14:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We've wasted too much time on bickering.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.48,0:14:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.32,0:14:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We should seize the chance to hit\Nthe boss while he's vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.48,0:14:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no other way. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.82,0:14:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We must proceed quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.30,0:14:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's dying. I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.60,0:14:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If we move closer...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.72,0:14:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It was Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.52,0:15:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss was hiding inside him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.22,0:15:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Spicy lady! Trish, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.30,0:15:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He was in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.02,0:15:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,At horrifying speed, he was able to close\Nthe distance in nearly no time at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.84,0:15:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet daughter, I've been\Nwaiting for this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.78,0:15:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Your stand finally appears before me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.92,0:15:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My Trish, had you not foolishly\Nrevealed your stand to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.40,0:15:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,your dear friends may very well\Nhave succeeded in their gambit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.34,0:15:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Release her at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.02,0:15:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as your stand is in my grasp,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.10,0:15:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear you're little more than a\Npuppet enslaved to my every whim.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.94,0:15:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going for a strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.20,0:15:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Brace yourselves, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.48,0:15:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Time is about to...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.70,0:15:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.26,0:15:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.04,0:15:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he forget to murder us first?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.02,0:15:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.48,0:16:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's likely we're not at the\Ntop of his list right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.60,0:16:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,His focus seems to be\Non seizing the arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.42,0:16:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only real thing that\Nmatters, and he knows it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.64,0:16:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot him, Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.64,0:16:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't be allowed to reach it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.58,0:16:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull the damn trigger!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.22,0:16:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,A few bullet wounds are nothing\Ncompared to what he will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.32,0:16:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the problem is\NI've already shot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.96,0:16:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I counted fired all six shots
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.44,0:16:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastards messing\Nwith time as he's running
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.14,0:16:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,if he sees him coming my\Nbullets can't touch him
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.02,0:16:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,After him it's all over\Nif he gets that arrow
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.02,0:16:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,that shadow it must hold the key to the\Narrows imperviousness let's see if my
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.98,0:17:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Theory proves to be correct. Requiem's\Nshadow always extends in the direction
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.38,0:17:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,opposing my movements regardless of the\Nsun's actual position that must mean
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.06,0:17:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,To that man's eyes, the shadow should\Nappear as if it is stretching toward me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.22,0:17:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But to Bucciarati, the shadow is\Nextending in front of Requiem itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.14,0:17:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,In other
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.68,0:17:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,words, the position of the shadow\Ndepends on the position of the observer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.92,0:17:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Cretanous, shade. Your\Npowers are no mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.26,0:17:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand how you manipulate souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.26,0:17:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Requiem is the silhouette of the soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.78,0:17:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,To face it is to contend with\Nthe shadow of one's own mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.54,0:17:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, attacking it is futile,\Nit's akin to attacking one's self.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.82,0:17:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If I eliminate this shadow,\Nthe arrow will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.44,0:17:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, wherever a shadow treads,\Na source of light must also be nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.20,0:17:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He still hasn't gotten the arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.28,0:17:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for Brando!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.08,0:18:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The only place it could\Nbe is behind my soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.04,0:18:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He struck something behind his\Nhead, yet Requiem suffered the blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.54,0:18:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.30,0:18:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're mine at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.78,0:18:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, the final victor\Nis I! I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.02,0:18:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if Diavolo somehow gets his vile\Nhands on the arrow, the fight goes on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.56,0:18:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just improvise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.02,0:18:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky for me, the blood he spilled when\Nhe severed my arm is just ordinary matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.02,0:18:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No different from anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.24,0:18:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now ain't that right, Golden Wind?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.58,0:18:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's showtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.38,0:18:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.44,0:18:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring that damn mongrel!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.52,0:18:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Not too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.30,0:18:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta catch up with them quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.56,0:18:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire again, Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.98,0:18:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get too close!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.28,0:18:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.32,0:18:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.23,0:19:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet you didn't predict\Nthat, you freakin' idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.62,0:19:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Deflect the bullets coming\Nat you all you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.66,0:19:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,you can't do jack shit\Nabout these other guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.28,0:19:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, fellas, y 'all\Nflick that baby back to Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.44,0:19:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.24,0:19:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He just launched a whole person!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.52,0:19:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,All the way toward the arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.14,0:19:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So he did predict our trajectory!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.24,0:19:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He used the body to course correct!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.14,0:19:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you truly believe, even for a moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.02,0:19:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,that your laughably slow wits could ever\Nhope to overcome my predictive mastery?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.74,0:19:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no flaws to exploit, as\NI'm sure you've recently learned.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.46,0:19:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,However, Bucciarati,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.54,0:19:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You and your gaggle did\Nmanage to make me try.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.56,0:19:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I never imagined you would be foolish\Nenough to betray your own familia.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.32,0:19:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Nor did I believe you competent\Nenough to discover my true identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.84,0:19:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm grateful this path has led\Nme to the true power of the arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.46,0:19:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Fate never fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.86,0:20:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A fitting reward for ones who have\Nconquered the adversity of their past.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.12,0:20:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, Reload, don't just stare.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.06,0:20:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We already told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.46,0:20:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That magazine takes us a\Nlittle bit longer to refill!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.12,0:20:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.12,0:20:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.80,0:20:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.86,0:20:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.38,0:20:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Spicy lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.48,0:20:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.62,0:20:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't deflect squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.16,0:20:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The bullets bounced.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.42,0:20:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.62,0:20:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I turned them to chewing gum.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.40,0:20:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They stretched out thin as they flew, But\Nthey clung to your fists the entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.96,0:20:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Then they sprung back\Nto me and through you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.68,0:20:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish, how long will you awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.38,0:20:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I too will conquer my past.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.98,0:20:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to be afraid, to\Nlive in fear of my fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.56,0:20:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't run from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.60,0:20:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If it gets in my way, then I'll climb.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.70,0:20:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as simple as that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.86,0:20:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The arrow! You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.62,0:21:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so damn close!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.68,0:21:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, I almost got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.58,0:21:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiss my ass, Diablo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.64,0:21:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and warp time or predict stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.92,0:21:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't change a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.26,0:21:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The arrow's coming to me, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.80,0:21:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear Geralt, how I wish I had never\Nbrought you into this wretched world!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.66,0:21:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems I've yet to break free of my past!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.32,0:21:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse it, worm!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.42,0:21:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I'm angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.20,0:21:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.70,0:21:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What was it you said about\Nfate? You just climb.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.38,0:21:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,am i right well i hope\Nyou like flying instead
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.20,0:21:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,there you go
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.42,0:21:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.64,0:22:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Join us. Come on, I'll save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.26,0:22:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Alive. We are the power. Who'll
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.34,0:22:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Feed the future. 'Cause we are.\NFight us? Just fighting for a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.88,0:23:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
